CLINICAL DISCLAIMER

The Triage Desk is a prototype clinical DECISION SUPPORT tool developed for
the Agentic AI for Africa Innovation Challenge. It is NOT a medical device,
NOT clinically validated, and MUST NOT be used for real patient care without:

1. Independent clinical validation by qualified clinicians at the target facility
2. Review and approval by the relevant health authority
3. Written permission from the Emergency Medicine Society of South Africa (EMSSA)
   for use of South African Triage Scale (SATS) thresholds
4. Compliance with applicable healthcare regulation in the deployment jurisdiction

The SATS threshold values are reproduced from peer-reviewed literature
(Gottschalk SB et al., Emergency Medicine Journal 2006;23(2):149–153; EMSSA 2012)
for educational and prototype demonstration purposes only.
